WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.190
My people! Today is history!

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.750
I'm a dad now — officially!

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.750
Felix, please — I'm the one who carried it
six months.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.250
The election I won! A landslide!

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.900
Mama, we have news… Ada is pregnant! Six
months!

6
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.240
Six months? And you're telling me today?

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Mama, we wanted to be sure everything was
fine first…

8
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.790
Sure of what?

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.310
That Felix is the father?

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.930
Mama! Ah-ah!

11
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.330
A woman who just arrived marries my only
son — now the bump shows.

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.490
In this Lagos, a person must ask.

13
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.910
Mama, I respect you.

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.430
This baby is your grandchild.

15
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.450
We'll see. DNA will talk.

16
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.500
Babe, she doesn't mean it… Mama is a
comedian.

17
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.120
Felix, you're the only comedian in this
house.

18
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.810
Meow… Mama's mind is suspicious.

19
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.610
Nobody will insult my child.

20
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.430
Nobody. I swear.

21
00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.770
Felix, carry my bags. From today, I'm
staying here.

22
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.550
The Lord has sent her… to watch.

23
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.600
That's how the trouble started.
